    {
      "id": "src:43",
      "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=30163561",
      "title": "Comment by vorpalhex on \"Google says Android tablets are the future, starts staffing up new division\"",
      "venue": "Hacker News comment thread; independent forum, no vendor ownership or sponsorship. The commenter is running his own written requirement list across five named note tools and rejecting each on it, which is the blocker's posture rather than a user's complaint",
      "speaker": "practitioner",
      "published": "2022-02-01",
      "pulled": "2026-09-17",
      "verbatim": "On notes:\n\n1. Notion doesn't have offline support, mobile exports don't work last I tried, no printing or sharing. Notion is block based, making it not appropriate for notes.\n\nA note taking app, must:\n\n+ Flow text correctly (not block based)\n\n+ Handle copying and pasting correctly without barfing my formatting\n\n+ Work offline. My notes are not useful if I can only get to them when I have internet.\n\n+ It should load instantly and have no lag."
